<title>JAPAN: Ajinomoto Gen Foods to raise instant coffee price.</title>
<headline>Ajinomoto Gen Foods to raise instant coffee price.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ajinomoto General Foods Inc (AGF) said on Thursday it will raise instant coffee prices by an average of 10 percent from July 1, due to high global coffee prices since the start of this year.  </p>
<p>AGF, one of Japan's leading coffee roasters, is a joint venture between Japan's Ajinomoto Co Inc and Philip Morris Cos Inc's Kraft Foods International Inc.</p>
<p>New York coffee futures surged to a 20-year-high last month on supply concerns at major producing countries and low stockpiles in the United States.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
</text>
